    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p>Hello, gamers Only episode 1 of the narrative is included in this game. Its early access game. Based on user feedback and support, will plan to release the final version of game. I hope you enjoy the game and help us.\r\n\r\nWe are grateful.\r\nSecernate Games.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Summary: A teenager falls from an alternate universe and attempts to survive in the present universe by looking \r\nfor shelter in a forest during the winter. Attempt to figure out how to return to his world, but \r\ndestiny had other plans, will our protagonist survive, will he receive assistance from others, and \r\nwill he be able to return to his universe?\r\n\r\nThe player interacts with and battles with yeti animals as the protagonist struggles to survive after falling into the winter wilderness. After moving on to the following cut scene, The Assailants, the antagonistic gang, kidnap the protagonist. In the first episode, the protagonist makes it back to their hub. In order to defend himself and flee from their base, the player begins interacting with and engaging in combat with the enemy gang members. The protagonist will learn some information about him along that process.\r\n\r\nThird Person Perspective Gameplay\r\nCut Scenes\r\nShooter Gameplay\r\nAction-Adventure Gameplay\r\nInteractive Gameplay",
